      "copy": [
        {
          "speaker": "Caption",
          "text": "Two mornings later. Ninth round complete."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Ossa",
          "text": "Give Kiva my morning."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "N7-02",
      "sha256": "d1564638c533b44c5501c0dc2510d16e393cac27e5197b1e849a7df71ea225fd",
      "copy": []
    },
    {
      "id": "N7-03",
      "sha256": "08a8d928434745ac7303f377c9a867da98e1662a512033c3b9c40eafbd230207",
      "copy": [
        {
          "speaker": "Kiva",
          "text": "Daro brought the packing stock up. His cart is below."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Daro",
          "text": "I would rather earn something on the way back."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "N7-04",
      "sha256": "b1359fec6f1f366f21fc9ef0a171aed9014a2cc10fc73ad7a7b64d1db82c4988",
      "copy": [
        {
          "speaker": "Kiva",
          "text": "This set is Rusk’s. The buyer’s is still in the jig."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "N7-05",
      "sha256": "b312c1a06b21531512187d3fcef99b182bd823c7fa85cd841e9a5c3d32c4c441",
      "copy": [
        {
          "speaker": "Aren",
          "text": "I thought I was taking it to Rusk."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Kiva",
          "text": "You are collecting it for me. We have not agreed the rest yet."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "N7-06",
      "sha256": "bab1c9b279c5001b1c20a7adb85d22b89dd780e7add0ee1ad88e53df50d0d031",
      "copy": [
        {
          "speaker": "Daro",
          "text": "Rusk asked for the rear yard today. His long frame is in the front aisle."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Daro",
          "text": "You bring the box to the landing. I take the cart leg; her board comes back with you."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "N7-07",
      "sha256": "ea404e46b68c6c8d7aaeb7edf54d2484d34418ef858757414f762f5685e0256e",
      "copy": [
        {
          "speaker": "Daro",
          "text": "The cart cannot climb these steps. From that landing, the ramp goes round to his yard."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "N7-38",
      "sha256": "4b48bd35fc52b612a58d5bf005d955f7541a007f4928e56d5060734073807aaf",
      "copy": [
        {
          "speaker": "Caption",
          "text": "Later, in his own room."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Sera",
          "text": "How was the collection?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "N7-39",
      "sha256": "7b5fd85fda20449eeffbe2fcc8848b55a3f6070f44eab6c13c4fa2a7c4509163",
      "copy": [
        {
          "speaker": "Aren",
          "text": "I only carried it halfway."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Sera",
          "text": "Did it arrive?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Aren",
          "text": "Yes."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "N7-40",
      "sha256": "ec4c18b480ea9a44e1e4cb2826c3a9d85d80a96703d472df32147e320c8007b3",
      "copy": [
        {
          "speaker": "Aren",
          "text": "Will you walk to the east washhouse with us after tomorrow’s round?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Sera",
          "text": "Yes. With the person handing the goods over."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
